OL,3,AI asked my husband to pay into my
OL,4,Apension when we had a child - here's
OL,5,Awhy
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen Molly and Taylor Haylett started
OL,8,Ftheir family, they hadn't really
OL,9,Fplanned for what it would mean
OL,10,Ffinancially.
OL,12,F"Our first child surprised us, so we
OL,13,Fweren't prepared for it," says Molly,
OL,14,F30, a financial adviser from Essex.
OL,16,FMolly and Taylor, who's a train driver,
OL,17,Fwere earning similar amounts, but once
OL,18,FMolly spent more time at home with
OL,19,Ftheir baby, the balance changed.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
