OL,3,AI asked my husband to pay into my
OL,4,Apension when we had a child - here's
OL,5,Awhy
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Taylor's career propelled and mine
OL,8,Ftook a step back," she says. "There's
OL,9,Fan unintended impact on the person who
OL,10,Fspends more time at home with the
OL,11,Fkids."
